      2: [{ week: 2, keyword: "review", question: "In _______ class, we learn to jump, roll, and balance.", options: ["Gymnastics", "audience", "dialogue", "stage​"], answer: "A", explanation: "Gymnastics意为\"体操\"。​ • 第3/4周 (cartwheel)​ ◦ 题干：A _______ is a move where you turn sideways on your hands.​ ◦ 选项：A) bow B) cartwheel C) stage D) stretch​ ◦ 正确答案：B​ ◦ 答案解析：cartwheel意为\"侧手翻\"。​ • 第5周（综合复习测试：涵盖 Gymnastics, cartwheel）​ ◦ 阅读文本：In Gymnastics, we move our bodies. We learn how to do a sideways flip called a cartwheel.​ ◦ 题干：What sideways flip do we learn?​ ◦ 选项：A) Gymnastics B) A stretch C) A cartwheel D) A stage​ ◦ 正确答案：C​ ◦ 答案解析：侧手翻(cartwheel)是体操(Gymnastics)中的基础动作。​ 【第二阶段：第7-9周】​ • 第7/8周 (cartwheel)​ ◦ 题干：You need strong arms to do a good sideways _______.​ ◦ 选项：A) cartwheel B) audience C) dialogue D) character​ ◦ 正确答案：A​ ◦ 答案解析：继续巩固侧手翻技能词汇。", passage: "In Gymnastics, we move our bodies. We learn how to do a sideways flip called a cartwheel.​" }],
      9: [{ week: 9, keyword: "review", question: "Reach your arms up high to _______ your body.​", options: ["Stretch", "cartwheel", "sing", "bow​"], answer: "A", explanation: "Stretch意为\"伸展/拉伸\"。​ • 第9周末（综合复习测试：涵盖 cartwheel, Stretch）​ ◦ 阅读文本：Before we do a cartwheel, we must warm up. We reach up high to Stretch our arms.​ ◦ 题干：What must we stretch?​ ◦ 选项：A) Our cartwheel B) Our arms C) Our face D) Our dialogue​ ◦ 正确答案：B​ ◦ 答案解析：在进行大动作前必须伸展(Stretch)四肢。​ 【第三阶段：第10-12周】​", passage: "Before we do a cartwheel, we must warm up. We reach up high to Stretch our arms.​" }],
      10: [{ week: 10, keyword: "review", question: "When doing a _______, your hands touch the floor while feet go up.​", options: ["Stretch", "cartwheel", "stage", "play"], answer: "B", explanation: "描述侧手翻特征。 • 第11/12周 (Stretch)​ ◦ 题干：To make your muscles long and warm, you should _______.​ ◦ 选项：A) Stretch B) stage C) character D) play​ ◦ 正确答案：A​ ◦ 答案解析：强化拉伸(Stretch)词汇。​ • 第12周末（综合复习测试：涵盖 cartwheel, Stretch）​ ◦ 阅读文本：We Stretch our arms and legs first. Now we are ready to flip and do a perfect cartwheel.​ ◦ 题干：Why do we stretch first?​ ◦ 选项：A) To fall down B) To get ready to do a cartwheel C) To sing a song D) To sleep​ ◦ 正确答案：B​ ◦ 答案解析：通过拉伸(Stretch)准备侧手翻(cartwheel)。​ 【第四阶段：第13-15周】​ • 第13/14周 (Stretch)​ ◦ 题干：If you feel tight, you need a good _______ to loosen up.​ ◦ 选项：A) cartwheel B) stretch C) lines D) emotions​ ◦ 正确答案：B​ ◦ 答案解析：针对紧绷状态需要拉伸。", passage: "We Stretch our arms and legs first. Now we are ready to flip and do a perfect cartwheel.​" }],
      15: [{ week: 15, keyword: "review", question: "After the show, we do a slow _______ to cool down.​", options: ["cartwheel", "Stretch", "lines", "emotions​"], answer: "B", explanation: "下课冷却放松的步骤。 • 第15周末（综合复习测试：涵盖 stretch）​ ◦ 阅读文本：We do a big cartwheel across the room. After moving fast, we sit down and Stretch our legs to cool down.​ ◦ 题干：When do we stretch our legs?​ ◦ 选项：A) After moving fast B) Before sleeping C) While eating D) During a cartwheel​ ◦ 正确答案：A​ ◦ 答案解析：理解体育表演后的放松。", passage: "We do a big cartwheel across the room. After moving fast, we sit down and Stretch our legs to cool down.​" }],
