      5: [{ week: 5, keyword: "review", question: "What do we do to find the answer of 3 groups of 1000?", options: ["We subtract them. B) We divide them. C) We multiply them. D) We scale them."], answer: "C", explanation: "", passage: "Today we learn big numbers. We know that 10 hundreds make one thousand. If we have 3 groups of 1000, we can multiply them. We say it is 3 times 1000, which equals 3000." }],
